== Lore ==
*According to a journal, [[Journal#The Father|The Father]], Sadan is Storm's son. And the reason Sadan decided to develop a technique that would defeat a Wither, however it is unknown if the Wither in question was Storm. 
*Based on the dialogue of [[The Wither King]], Storm was his favorite Sparring partner.
*To gain his third head, [[Storm]] absorbed [[Solomon]], a very powerful human mage, sent with the expedition to [[The Catacombs|{{red|The Catacombs}}]].
*After humans discovered {{red|The Catacombs}} and sent an expedition there, which has not returned, '''Storm''' was sent by Necron to destroy the Human castle, which has survived both [[Calamity|{{DarkRed|Calamity}}]] and [[Kaeman|Kaeman's]] hunt for vengeance.
== Trivia ==
*'''Storm''' seems to be the most egoistic of the five Withers, a trait he shares with his son [[Sadan]]. They both however seem to make up with each other when faced with death, as their last words reference each other.
*'''Storm''' was going to be the {{mcat|b}} of [[The Catacombs - Floor IX]] before Hypixel removed [[Maxor]], [[Goldor]] and Storm from the game and replaced them with [[Necron]].
**All three bosses were later re-added to The Catacombs - Floor VII.
*{{Item|Storm's Armor}} and {{Item|Storm the Fish}} are references to this boss.
*Luring Storm into the red pad area softlocks the fight. It is unknown if this glitch is still present.
